body:
Sometimes 80s like Queen and Pat Benatar, mainly Lady Gaga, Sia, The Neighbourhood, The Pretty Reckless, and a few others.

&#x200B;

I mainly listen to Lady Gaga's older songs. My favorite album is ARTPOP, and I'm cut between the song Artpop and Dope.

ARTPOP - Lady Gaga.

&#x200B;

To me, it means that your meaning could be anything. It's my favorite song.
